# Instructions

Implement `std::optional<std::int64_t> temporal_tagged_era(EraStamp stamp)` in `temporal-tagged-era.h` with exactly the documented return type.

Translate one of three explicit epoch tags to Unix seconds. Validate tag-specific alignment and checked offsets. The return applies tag-specific checked epoch offsets and alignment rules.

